# headwear/helm/crest/fin: the forge crest accent `fin` (STYLE_P2 28.3, contracts 3c: overlay crest.<v>, anchor crown)
# A swept fin (crane, heron, leaf): thin from the front, in profile a blade rising high at the brow and sweeping back
# past the nape in a long curling tail.
# Written by the FORGE-HELM area's tools/gen.py from src/ (the hand-drawn D U R views; L is R re-lit). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
body adult
role overlay crest.fin
layer headwear
anchor crown
keys hatpose
z 2
tags overlay
legend v metal 0
legend w metal 1
legend x metal 2
legend y metal 3
legend z metal 4
legend J metal2 0
legend N metal2 1
legend O metal2 2
legend P metal2 3
legend Q metal2 4
